# Supabase Project Configuration (Serverless / Free Tier)
# In production, set these via GitHub Actions Secrets or your hosting environment:
# - VITE_SUPABASE_URL (e.g., https://xyzcompany.supabase.co)
# - VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY (Public anon key from Supabase Project Settings > API)
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=

